WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:04,700
It doesn't matter whether I saved him or not

2
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:06,610
What's important is that you're okay

3
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:07,850
not hurt

4
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:11,150
not important to you

5
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:12,270
But it's different for me

6
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:13,750
I still regard you as

7
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:15,270
It's the trouble my dad forced on me.

8
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:16,550
I'll try my best to drive you away

9
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:20,050
You're actually pretty good. What did you say?

10
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:22,050
Don’t be forgiving with your words, but don’t be evil in your heart.

11
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,830
Is this a compliment to me?

12
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:27,740
Then tell me

13
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,140
Why did my dad lie to me?

14
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,500
Why is it called robbery?

15
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,660
And why didn't you tell me that you saved me?

16
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:35,440
I don’t tell you because I’m afraid you’ll be scared

17
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:37,200
Arrange for me to protect you

18
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,600
I'm also worried that something will happen to you again

19
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:40,590
I simply think

20
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:42,070
It's my father who is overbearing and unreasonable

21
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:44,420
he is a good father

22
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,980
I haven't found out who is trying to kidnap him.

23
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:52,030
Will they come again?

24
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,220
Now is a society ruled by law

25
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,160
You are not an ordinary person

26
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:58,700
The last time I took such a big risk, I didn't succeed.

27
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:03,740
If the other party won't give up, what should you do now that I'm here?

28
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:09,100
you said before

29
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,220
Promise to protect me

30
00:01:10,380 --> 00:01:11,900
It's because I owe my dad a favor

31
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:15,140
What did my dad help you with?

32
00:01:15,420 --> 00:01:21,060
Tingting guessed that she would take care of her mother by mistake.

33
00:01:21,060 --> 00:01:22,740
She had to take a few months' leave

34
00:01:23,210 --> 00:01:24,770
It's not easy to go back

35
00:01:25,330 --> 00:01:26,890
Plus can't afford tuition

36
00:01:27,090 --> 00:01:28,010
Just want to learn wrongly

37
00:01:29,220 --> 00:01:30,260
It was Mr. Zhang who helped her do it.

38
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:33,220
The reversal procedure paid the tuition for me

39
00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:34,660
Tingting can continue to study

40
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:37,340
This is more important than anything else

41
00:01:37,540 --> 00:01:46,300
Can you come to school? What's the matter?
